<title>NETHERLANDS: ECONOSTO BUYS BELGIAN, DUTCH FIRMS.</title>
<headline>ECONOSTO BUYS BELGIAN, DUTCH FIRMS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical wholesaler Koninklijke Econosto NV said on Tuesday it had bought Brussels-based Hydraulic Components &amp; Systems NV.</p>
<p>The firm is importer in Belgium of Econosto subsidiary Koppen &amp; Lethem's products and posts annual turnover of about 10 million Belgian francs.</p>
<p>Econosto said it had also taken over Dutch firm Holland Valves Services BV. This company has its clients in the petrochemical and chemical industry sectors and has annual turnover of about ninve million guilders.</p>
<p>No financial details of the transactions were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
